\pard\b\fs20 Year 147: Lightning Flash in Frangreich\b0\par
\fs16\par
An old friend of the Holy Spaceship Empire of the Clonkish Nation, Count Pond du Champagnje, has sadly turned renegade. He and his people were to get to the bottom of a natural phenomenon from which we hope for a great deal. With the help of some metals he has managed to tame the power of lightning. But now he wants to use it not to save us all, but to rule us all. With his followers, du Champagnje has settled into an abandoned fortress near the mountains, and is refitting it for his selfish research. He must be executed, and his notes on "electricity" secured and learned.\par
\par
\b Goal:\b0\par
Fetch du Champagnje's notes on electricity and finish the research.\par
